Obre_arcs_Busca_arc_costat_corregeix, "1- Open the arc (%s.arc) file with MiraMon\n2- Find the problem arc with the query by attribute tool.\nOpen file %s.vec in editing mode and correct the error (delete the arc or add the missing ones)\n4- Run CreaTop again."
