Mira_s_TXT_Corregeix_s_s,            "1- View file %s.txt (notepad %s.txt)\n2- Edit file %s.vec and/or file %s and correct errors\n3- Run CreaTop again."
Mira_QUEIXESL_BADLINE,               "1- View file QUEIXESL.txt (notepad queixesl.txt)\n2- If necessary, open file BADLINE.vec\n   over %s.pol file3- Edit file %s.vec and/or file %s.vec and correct errors\n4- Run CreaTop again."
